            "textpurpose":"Provenance",
            "textentryhtml":"<p>\n\tBy 1989, Gillett G. Griffin (1928-2016), Princeton, NJ [1]; 2016, bequeathed to the Princeton University Art Museum.\n</p>\n<p>\n\tNotes:\n\t<br />\n\t[1] Griffin lent to the Museum in 1989 (L.1989.36).\n</p>",
